<PurposeNote Title="Purpose" Icon="💼">
    <p>
        This page explains why OperationsFlow has portfolio value for real employers. It is not just a CRUD demo.
        It shows how operational work can be captured, assigned, evidenced, reviewed, reported, and prepared for either a local SQL-backed deployment or a Microsoft 365 production deployment.
    </p>
</PurposeNote>

