<GuidanceNote Title="Business value conclusion" Icon="🏁" Tone="success">
    <p>
        OperationsFlow is valuable because it shows practical business systems thinking: capture the work, assign ownership,
        attach evidence, check completeness, report gaps, trace activity, control access, and design the system so it can run locally
        or grow into a Microsoft 365 production implementation.
    </p>
</GuidanceNote>